{"id":"59243175-312d-488a-bfe9-d83ce0e30f49","revision":0,"last_node_id":15,"last_link_id":25,"nodes":[{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1454.441039637983,-518.4425379410995],"size":[407.3079791576681,282.8736620940183],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Model Links","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Model Links\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors)\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/checkpoints/stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors\n```\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Model Links\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors)\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/checkpoints/stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors\n```\n"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":13,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1449.0643783491585,-185.66195747389204],"size":[400.50258274822727,440.50048498415157],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# ComfyUI Stable Audio 3 Editing\n\nComfyUI-native init-audio, inpainting, and continuation nodes for Stable Audio 3. The pack uses ComfyUI's existing checkpoint loader, Stable Audio text encoder, VAE, KSampler, model management, and audio decoder. It adds no dependencies and does not download models.\n\n## Nodes\n\n- **Stable Audio 3 Inpaint Region** selects one time range to regenerate.\n- **Stable Audio 3 Inpaint Conditioning** accepts one or more region nodes, prepares the model's inpaint conditioning, and optionally preserves source latents outside the selected regions.\n\nSource audio is resampled to 44.1 kHz, converted to stereo, and aligned for the Stable Audio 3 VAE.\n\n## Recommended sampling\n\nUse the settings from ComfyUI's Stable Audio 3 workflow:\n\n- 8 steps\n- CFG 1\n- `lcm` sampler\n- `simple` scheduler\n\nFor continuation, create an inpaint region from the source duration to the target duration. The inpaint conditioning node extends the output duration to the region end automatically.\n\nThe nodes require a Stable Audio 3 VAE with 256 latent channels and 4096x temporal compression. They do not support the older Stable Audio 1 model.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# ComfyUI Stable Audio 3 Editing\n\nComfyUI-native init-audio, inpainting, and continuation nodes for Stable Audio 3. The pack uses ComfyUI's existing checkpoint loader, Stable Audio text encoder, VAE, KSampler, model management, and audio decoder. It adds no dependencies and does not download models.\n\n## Nodes\n\n- **Stable Audio 3 Inpaint Region** selects one time range to regenerate.\n- **Stable Audio 3 Inpaint Conditioning** accepts one or more region nodes, prepares the model's inpaint conditioning, and optionally preserves source latents outside the selected regions.\n\nSource audio is resampled to 44.1 kHz, converted to stereo, and aligned for the Stable Audio 3 VAE.\n\n## Recommended sampling\n\nUse the settings from ComfyUI's Stable Audio 3 workflow:\n\n- 8 steps\n- CFG 1\n- `lcm` sampler\n- `simple` scheduler\n\nFor continuation, create an inpaint region from the source duration to the target duration. The inpaint conditioning node extends the output duration to the region end automatically.\n\nThe nodes require a Stable Audio 3 VAE with 256 latent channels and 4096x temporal compression. They do not support the older Stable Audio 1 model.\n"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":2,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[-1000.7257590420002,-324.6400963981539],"size":[360.4087707703486,106],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip_name","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"type","name":"type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"device","name":"device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":0,"links":[1,2]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader"},"widgets_values":["t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors","stable_audio","default"],"widgets_values_named":{"clip_name":"t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors","type":"stable_audio","device":"default"},"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":5,"type":"LoadAudio","pos":[-555.7177513962258,-65.76076345106654],"size":[382.08542676170316,136],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"audio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"audioUI","name":"audioUI","type":"AUDIO_UI","widget":{"name":"audioUI"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"AUDIOUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"AUDIO","name":"AUDIO","type":"AUDIO","slot_index":0,"links":[18]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadAudio"},"widgets_values":["",null,null],"widgets_values_named":{"audio":"","upload":null},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":6,"type":"StableAudio3InpaintRegion","pos":[-458.1127869563413,121.21998868069383],"size":[277.82511182867484,82],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"start_seconds","name":"start_seconds","type":"FLOAT","wi